OL,3,GNEWSALandmark to open for first time in
OL,4,A40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark in the West Midlands is to
OL,7,Fopen to the public for the first time
OL,8,Fin about 40 years, as part of a
OL,9,Ffestival celebrating England's
OL,10,Fheritage.
OL,12,FThe Grade II-listed Sedgley Beacon
OL,13,Ftower will welcome visitors from 10:00
OL,14,Fto 13:30 BST on Friday and from 10:00
OL,15,Fto 14:00 on Sunday as part of this
OL,16,Fyear's Heritage Open Days.
OL,18,FThe tower, on Beacon Hill north of
OL,19,FSedgley town centre, has been
OL,20,Finaccessible because of the poor
OL,21,Fcondition of its steps.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
