OL,3,GNEWSALandmark to open for first time in
OL,4,A40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough visitors will not be allowed
OL,7,Fto climb the tower staircase, they will
OL,8,Fbe able to stand inside and see recent
OL,9,Frestoration work, which has included
OL,10,Fthe replacement of most of the steps.
